{"summary":"Defend your dungeons with deadly traps against greedy adventurers!","description":"Dungeon Warfare 2 is the definitive sequel to Dungeon Warfare, a challenging tower defense strategy game where you become a dungeon lord to defend your dungeons with the deadliest of traps and insidious contraptions against greedy adventurers and wannabe heroes.\nGame Features\n* Physics-enabled tower defense mayhem\n* 33 unique traps with 8 unique traits for each trap\n* More than 30 unique enemies, each with a special trait\n* More than 60 handcrafted levels + an infinite number of procedurally generated dungeons\n* 5+ boss battles\n* Progression with experience providing passive upgrades for the traps as well as skill points\n* Three skill trees with 11 skills on each tree\n* Equipment system with more than 30 unique items\n* Mix your own difficulty by combining difficulty mode runes for more challenge & reward\n* Endless mode\n* Environmental Hazards","esrbNotes":"Violence, Blood","pegiNotes":"Moderate Violence","iapPrices":null,"video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/sFN-PH-WJBo?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/O4nkUCL1_dv-SyZDnIpfHmzCXxW8xGykzjiqR2bj5S9eAWFJKlbQK_Ctd9Hqn5ISv6UEEy13VWlm4m0lH7Oys_8","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/k4tFzkHEZbyfWRHIVNTFQ3zs2SS5Wc0NrmOwKc8-4alimaBWm7AH9uCBnyPou9DMP-Cr0HfaPVi1wixa89JWVA","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Pjo5qSLQS6jXONJI1AvoC24cazLQS8U5pNrnllRq8qxe-ER7ZauuzRY-8jxyM_hs-DhdOUxm-NDk0mrBjGC3sg","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/XO5PuUmmWJW_JYdKadF6Hl5JVelWm77PH8DZPbDfBTFXf3-qCpd1EA3uFzD26EXTdOcmevzDhWgWJ4ado7XTCQ","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/a6jr8Z43WO8Cw36Ha7Xtnhq_3NaqGOgUM6S8VW0PU74KTRYihIC8-lKY78IHVN2YwrhEsJLXdRFmHlliIG9HCQ","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/aT0B-e2vZnGLQ05EpWE9kxMTQS1YelBUQZeE0aCR_-5myX0nyBSEmxjIQglQrd7ZDTQ1Y2WGw-2u3L6_RdL3Ug","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/PyaB4oE0HpqewBqRd1HZiU9C-sCNRxDBgWeRyP-jG96